<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλή</span></b> , ἡ, only pl.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλαί</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>salt-works</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλαὶ τῶν ὀρυκτῶν ἁλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.3.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἅλυς . . ὠνόμασται ἀπὸ τῶν ἁλῶν
					ἃς παραρρεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					12.3.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλάς, ἁλαῖς</span> shd. be read
			for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλας, ἄλλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				92.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
